1	// sc4sap:program-to-manual — the page's labels, stylesheet and script.
2	//
3	// Kept apart from build-manual.mjs so the builder reads as document assembly.
4	// Everything is inlined into the one .html file; nothing loads from the network.
5	//
6	// On screen the manual is a scrolling document with a contents sidebar. In
7	// print (or "Save as PDF") every scenario step starts a new A4 landscape page,
8	// like a slide, and the confidentiality notice repeats at the foot of each page.
9	//
10	// The script draws the callouts: for each screen figure it finds the elements
11	// the step names (the renderer wraps them in <g data-anchor>), and adds a red
12	// frame and a numbered badge in the SVG's own coordinates, so the marks scale
13	// and print with the image. Without the script the numbered list still reads.
14	
